{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50656","headline":"哭微之 · 白居易","name":"哭微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今在岂有相逢日，未死应无暂忘时。\n从此三篇收泪後，终身无复更吟诗。\n（见《文苑英华》。\n）（按《全唐诗》载《哭微之》诗二首，其诗原附於白居易《祭微之文》，畧谓无以寄悲情，作哀词二首云云。\n《全唐文》卷六百八十一及坊刻《白香山集》均载之。\n惟《文苑英华》卷九百八十九《祭微之文》则谓作哀词三首，其第三首爲）（诸本所无。\n承友人顾学颉先生函告，爰补录於此。\n或以其出处不明爲疑，则俟方家之考定於来更可耳。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}